WEBVTT

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:09.760
The Onibaku are coming!

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.760
Everybody, run!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.760
Monsters!!

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.920
Give yourselves to us!

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.380
Get your act together, you two!

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.700
Ryuuji, I've spotted more prey...

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.850
Yeah...

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.050
H-Hey... hold on you guys!

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.100
Ittadakimasu!!

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.290
You two report to the office!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.900
Is it really okay to keep this up, Ryuuji?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.220
Is this the high school life
we've been dreaming of?

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:53.290
Damn! Won't someone put some
love in my miserable life?!

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.860
So c'mon, let's go out, just the two of us.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:58.040
Well, but...

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.670
C'mon! It'll be fun!

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.790
Makoto!!

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.690
S-Sorry!

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.440
How dare you flirt right in front of our eyes?

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:12.140
You're gonna die for that!

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.750
H-Hold on! I have something great to tell you!

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.370
Valentine Parade?

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:21.300
What's that?

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.730
Don't you know?

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:26.140
It's the parade that happens
once a year along the beach.

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:28.370
Oh, some car freak contest?

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:30.350
I couldn't care less.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.750
Oh, that's to bad...

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:36.200
since they say the winner
gets all the action he can take.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.260
WHAAAT?!

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:40.390
Why didn't you say so?!

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.670
This is last year's winner, Masaru-kun.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:46.900
A Porsche... pickup?!

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.640
I've never heard of that.

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:52.610
That masterpiece is a Porsche
front on a Datsun pickup.

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:54.300
But check this out...

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:56.380
Look at the girls around Masaru-kun.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.700
They're all beauties!

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:02.420
Dammit, he gets all those girls
even with his monkey ass face?

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:05.570
All right, I got it. If we get
this guy out of the picture...

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:09.370
and enter the parade, we can win, right?

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.220
He died.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.600
H-He died?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.200
From too much sex.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.530
Too much sex?!

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:24.180
According to the rumors, they say he had
sex with 3 women a night for a month.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:28.200
He looked like a mummy by the end, it seems.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.590
They say he had an incredibly
happy smile on his face.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.290
All right... now I'm ready for some action!

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:40.170
Yeah! We're gonna win this year's championship!

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:54.000
SHONAN JUNAI GUMI!

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:54.000
2

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:59.790
How the hell do we get a car?

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.010
If only a car would drop right into our laps.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:09.170
Please, let me use your restroom!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.940
I guess cars do just fall into our laps!

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.720
But there's no way we'd
impress anyone with this thing.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.540
Check this out...

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.730
A KS Benz! You're gonna turn it into that?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.130
Exactly! There's no doubt we're gonna win!

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:35.950
We sure are!

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.550
Satou Garage

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.490
What?!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.490
You're telling me to remodel this Cedric into a KS Benz?!

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:47.410
Exactly.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:51.050
A KS Benz will mean a sure victory
for us in the Valentine Parade.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.070
This is pretty sudden, you know...

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:59.100
Well, Masami-kun, we'll give you a week.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:02.070
Our victory is in your hands!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.750
Hey, wait!

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.280
Well, we got the car ready.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:13.490
All right, we're gonna do it. Even
if it means becoming mummies!

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:15.710
To sex until we die!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.510
To death!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.470
One week later

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:26.470
Satou Garage

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.470
Masami-kun, is the car ready?

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.230
Hmm, maybe he left.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.570
It-it's finished!

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:34.430
Awesome! It's just like the one in the picture.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.550
Look! He even put the steering wheel on the left!

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:41.010
Now there's no doubt we're gonna win, eh, Eikichi?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:43.000
Not good...

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:46.020
Looking like a Benz isn't enough.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.150
I guess I fell asleep.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.040
But I did manage to get it ready somehow.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.620
It looks just like a KS Benz!

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.440
Yeah, I wish...

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:11.690
But having a real example of
one on hand really saved me.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:17.120
The KS Benz! A real one was right here!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.480
Right here!

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.220
IT'S GOOOOONE!!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.400
What'd you say is gone?

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:28.070
The owner!!

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:49.080
Hey, look at that new Z!

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.850
Awesome! Is that really a Z? It's like an F40.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.960
Totally! That's cooool!

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.730
Don't you think this is the best one so far?

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.550
Clearly no other car stands a chance...

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.100
Whoa! What's that?

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.210
I want in!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:09.770
I wanna ride!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.280
Cuuuuute!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.680
I like this one!

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:15.390
Me too!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:22.010
That won't get you anywhere, Abe-kun.
Girls go for the novelty.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.650
I'm sure to win this year.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:28.920
What's that noise?

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.220
A-A Gull Wing!!

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:42.330
KS Benz?!

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:49.440
The Onibaku

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.180
Awesome!

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.520
These Onibaku are really cool...

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.290
I love that Benz!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.400
There's nothing better this year!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.200
They love it! They love the gull wings!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:01.400
Everyone totally thinks it's a real KS Benz.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:04.760
They don't even realize it's just a Cedric!

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.970
You think saying you lost is gonna help?!

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.680
No, sir...!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.350
Yokokawa-san's Benz is worth over
20 million yen, you little punk!

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:21.240
You know what'll happen if anything, and I
mean anything happens to my car, right?!

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.200
<i>Please save me, God!!</i>

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.250
Y-Yokokawa-san!

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.720
There's a KS Benz just like yours by the beach,

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.460
but its sides are replaced with gull wings!

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.260
WHAAAAT?!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.700
<i>Don't tell me those guys...</i>

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:42.700
<i>Well then, the winner of this
year's Valentine Parade is...</i>

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:48.160
<i>The Onibaku's Gull Wings KS Benz!</i>

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:57.130
Okay, okay! Who's going to be the first to ride?

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.270
Yeaaah!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.810
It'll be us!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.190
Yeeeeessss!

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:04.320
Cuuuuute!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:06.560
What's wrong?

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:09.010
Oh, nothing! Nothing at all!

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:12.790
We're just so happy we can offer a ride
to beautiful ladies such as yourselves.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:14.450
Oh, you...

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:16.100
You're too sweet!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:25.060
Satou-san, prepare yourself
for when I confirm it's my car.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.720
Prepare... myself?

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.390
<i>If this is a dream, let me wake up soon...</i>

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.410
By the way Yuuna-chan and Miki-chan,

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.920
have you ever rode in a Benz before?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.860
No, I've never.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.190
My boyfriend has a Benz just like this one.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.810
You have a boyfriend?!

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:52.030
Yeah, but to tell you the truth, he
has some dangerous connections...

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:55.020
And I'd like to find some way to break up with him.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.760
Oh, just go ahead and break up with that guy.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:01.080
Eikichi-kun, will you run away with me?

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:04.910
Of course I will. I'd run to the
end of the earth with you.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.290
Really?!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.060
I'll hold on to you forever!

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:14.430
<i>Dammit, that lucky bastard...</i>

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:15.580
Hey, Ryuuji-kun...

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:20.110
You must be pretty popular with girls, right?

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.900
N-No, not at all! I'm not that kind of guy!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:25.930
Really?

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.910
Then maybe I could be your girl!

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:30.900
Really?!

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:32.550
Yep!

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:36.330
<i>Yes! Spring has come for me too!</i>

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.510
We did it!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.510
Oh, I guess he put a phone in too.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:47.040
Hello! This is Mr. Lucky.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.490
<i>You idiots! What are you doing?</i>

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:53.290
Masami-kun, this is awesome!
It's totally like a real Benz!

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:56.360
<i>Of course it is, because it is a real Benz!</i>

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:56.990
What?

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:01.130
I was asked to repair the KS by some
dangerous guys and you go and--

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:06.950
Hey! So you're the thief. How dare you steal a
man's Benz right from under his eyes?

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:09.810
<i>We're coming after you, so get ready
for the beating of your life!</i>

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:14.350
I think we're going to need to get
ready for a long vacation, Ryuuji...

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.250
Huh?

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.190
This KS Benz is the real thing!

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.150
Eh?!

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:21.910
And it sounds like it's owned by a yakuza!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.010
WHAAAT?!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:31.220
Hey! Pull over, you pieces of shit!

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:32.950
They're here!

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:35.260
Pull over or we'll really kill you, dammit!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:38.110
Are you freaking deaf? I said pull over!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.190
Takashi!

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:44.530
Don't you dare ignore us! Pull over!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:49.590
Hey, boy! You've got some balls to not
only steal my car but my woman too!

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.200
What do you mean your woman?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:57.890
You must really want to die.
You'd better stop, dammit!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:02.600
Shut up, you rotten yakuza!
I have a new boyfriend now.

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.670
I never want to see your face again!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:06.390
Eikichi-kun, floor it!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:06.990
Yes!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.440
I'm gonna kill you!!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.040
Aah! I feel better now.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:19.290
Now we're on the run together, Eikichi-kun?

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:23.130
M-Miki-chan, you were dating
that dangerous old guy?

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:24.520
Old guy?

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:28.160
How rude. Even though he looks old, he's only 17.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.090
Seventeen?!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.330
Looking like that?!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.840
Pull over, dammit! I'm gonna kill you guys!

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.770
What are we going to do, Eikichi?

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.980
Hey, take the wheel.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.490
The only choice we have is to run!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.950
We'll run to the end of the earth!

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:52.660
You deserved that!

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:53.370
Here!

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:57.910
The Onibaku won't be defeated by the likes of you!

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:01.470
You freaking idiot! What are you
doing taking the steering wheel?!

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:02.950
When did that happen?

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.670
You're the one that took it, you blockhead!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.940
What do you think you're doing, swinging at me?!

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.520
You wanna fight?!

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.110
Look out!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:24.940
Umm...

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.980
You don't really do this nowadays, do you?

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:32.870
You can't put us in cement barrels...

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:37.940
We ain't doing this cuz it's fashionable.
This is tradition.

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:42.390
Why are you saying that with such a scary face? Hurry up and get us out of here.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:45.320
You may look like a geezer, but
we're fellow high schoolers.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:47.890
DIE!!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.750
If you don't wanna die, then
get 50 million yen for me!

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.770
All right Miki, let's go!

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:03.370
I'd rather die with Eikichi-kun
than go anywhere with you!

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.250
I'm gonna beat you if you don't
learn your place, you little bitch!

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:11.000
What? Do you think women will
listen to you if you beat them?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:14.020
Eikichi-kun isn't like that! He's sweet!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:22.960
Bring a hundred million yen!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.560
If you do, I'll let you have my woman, got it?!

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.080
As you wish!!

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.420
A hundred million ain't nothing to me but a
fart in the wind, you damn yakuza!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:40.620
Just wait, I'll pick up the cash and
then hit your place up for a fight!

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.700
Miki, I'll rescue you. I promise!

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:45.480
Eikichi-kun...!

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.380
Interesting. You're gonna get the money, huh?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.270
Tomorrow at 6pm is the time limit.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.520
If you don't show with the money...

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:57.400
200 of my guys will be out for your life, got it?

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:04.080
Not bad, Eikichi! Talking rough to a yakuza.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.620
I didn't think you'd have the balls.

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:11.420
What am I gonna do, Ryuuji?!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.430
Let's go on a long vacation
until things cool down.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.940
Let's go see Hokkaido.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.940
Whaaaa?!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.250
There's no hope, Ryuuji.
They're on the lookout for us.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:37.010
With all these guys, we really
are gonna get killed.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:47.690
Morning's here. What are we gonna do, Eikichi?

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:52.940
No sleeping!!

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:57.290
How can you sleep at a time like this?

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.930
I was nervous, I didn't mean to.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:03.840
This is all because you had to go
and put gull wings on the car.

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:04.600
What?!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:08.020
Those guys wouldn't be so pissed
if you didn't screw with it.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.720
What'd you say?!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:13.460
Are you saying this is my fault?

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.960
I sure am!!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.030
You sure looked excited about it yourself!!

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.800
T-This is from middle school!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.010
We've found it now! Our hundred million yen!

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.570
Yeah, we got it.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:38.310
Looks like they missed the deadline.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:43.780
Did they really think they could make that
kind of money when they're just kids?

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.560
<i>Eikichi-kun, why didn't you come for me?</i>

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:52.190
Well, I guess we'll have to go find
them and beat them to death.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:54.610
What's that?

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.070
They're coming!

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:05.620
Who are you bastards?!
show your faces, dammit!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.690
We came to bring you the hundred million.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.900
You little brats!

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.250
Eikichi-kun!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.580
Dammit! They're making fools of us.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.830
You brat!

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.330
Come and fight, you petty thieves!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.300
You damn little brats!!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:34.080
Just try and take our lives!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.740
Don't you dare get cocky! I'll slice you apart!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.310
Stop it! They're going to die if you use that!

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:41.520
Shut up!

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:44.620
T-Those kids are...

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:49.610
Yo, Boss! We came to hand over the hundred million.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:50.900
Eikichi-kun!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.650
I see... looks like you're good in a fight.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:59.390
But it ain't as simple as taking out a few yakuza.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:08.170
Harm me, the successor of this gang, and your families will be targeted next.

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:11.020
They'll hunt you down until you're dead.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:15.670
If that's what you want, go
ahead and attack me!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:20.310
You've really gotten a big
head, Yokokawa-sempai.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:25.730
Have you forgotten your juniors in
middle school, Yokokawa-sempai?

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.560
Or rather... Yokochin!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:32.980
What'd you call me? I controlled the 2nd year
class, but, I don't remember you guys.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:36.910
Seems your eyes are as bad
as ever, Yokochin-sempai.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.770
What?

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:42.740
Demon Gang Special Forces Onizuka Eikichi!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:45.520
Dragon Crest Bomber Danma Ryuuji!

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:53.210
No way!! Not the Onizuka and Danma that
embarrassed me in middle school!

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:56.190
Oh, so you remember us?

00:17:56.430 --> 00:18:02.110
Yokokawa-sempai, now that you're the successor
to a Yakuza gang, we didn't recognize you.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:08.250
Shut up! Don't think you can scare
me like that! I'm different now!

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.600
I'm the successor to a Yakuza gang!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:13.520
Well, don't burst a vein over it.

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.860
We knew that, so we made sure to
prepare the hundred million yen.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:18.580
Beg for it.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.640
Here's your hundred million!

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.240
You remember, don't you?

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.180
When you 3rd years failed to take over our class,

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:33.830
we made you take a shit in front of girls.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.510
You think you can scare me with that?

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:41.950
I had my friend at a newspaper
make copies of that pictures for me.

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:48.420
Tomorrow morning, he'll be delivering
the paper with copies of that picture in it.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:52.380
A yakuza successor forced to
take a shit in front of everyone.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:55.720
Well, make your choice, kill us
and live in embarrassment...

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:58.520
...or buy it for a hundred million yen.

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:03.480
P-Please... give that picture back to me.

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:06.510
No can do, no can do!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:10.980
I beg you! I'll forget what you
did to my car, my office...

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.130
just give me that picture!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.750
You went all out on the Onibaku, you know.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.800
You don't really think you can
make it all better so easily, do you?

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:26.290
Please! I won't be able to live if that's
delivered to the whole city!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:30.230
Well, I guess I'm compelled
to return it to an old friend.

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:31.930
Really?!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:32.890
But...!

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:37.790
You gotta take a shit in front of us again.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.940
<i>N-No way...!</i>

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:54.040
That guy hasn't changed a bit
even though he's a yakuza now.

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.840
He's still a crybaby.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:56.940
Yeah, yeah!

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:02.260
Well, I'm glad you really did
come for me, Eikichi-kun.

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:05.370
Silly girl... I said I'd save you, didn't I?

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:07.620
Will you be my boyfriend?

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:08.900
Of course!

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:09.810
Thank you!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:18.300
My apartment is right around the corner.
I want you to stay over night.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:25.900
H-Hey, wait, you guys! Hey, I said wait... Eikichi!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.910
Do you intend to go into battle
before me, you bastard?!

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:29.580
Ryuuji...

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:34.320
You'll be my friend even if I
lose my virginity, won't you?

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:39.020
No way... Eikichi-kun, you're a virgin?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.260
Yeah... the truth is... I am!

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:43.380
No way! I can't believe it!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.940
You idiot!!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.170
You really have a nice place.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:53.350
You think so?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.840
Mommy, welcome home!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.050
Mommy!

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:02.190
I'm home!

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:03.950
I'm sorry I'm so late.

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:07.580
Mommy, who's this guy?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.650
This is your new daddy starting today!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:14.490
Our daddy?

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:15.190
Yes!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.730
He beat up the old daddy!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.950
Yay! Our new daddy!

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:22.300
Daddy!

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:27.250
I'm too young to be a daddy!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.660
Wait, Eikichi-kun!

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.170
Don't laugh, you bastard!

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.770
There's no way she could have
really liked you in the first place.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.040
What'd you say?!

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.270
I heard about the Onibaku's latest exploits!

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:44.290
That you totaled a yakuza's
car and raided his office!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.180
It's no big deal...

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.390
That's just how powerful we are.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.850
It's to be expected from the Onibaku!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:54.530
You have to be the strongest in Shonan!

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.340
Of course we are!

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:00.980
If you ever get in a fight,
call on us. We got your back.

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:03.150
Onizuka-kun! Danma-kun!

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.130
Won't you come to the office with me?

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:08.380
Yeah, yeah, Mariko-chan!

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:10.190
Call me sensei... Sensei.

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:10.800
Sure, sure...

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:14.200
Best in Shonan? His words don't mean shit.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.220
Hey, watch where you're going!

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:23.840
Heh? When did I say you
could speak to me like that?

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:27.320
No... since when do you talk like that to me?

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:30.310
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:22:30.810 --> 00:22:32.440
I'm a friend of the Onibaku.

00:22:33.340 --> 00:22:38.120
What's so great about them? They
won't be able to act big forever!

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:40.820
You'll find that out when
Saejima-kun and Kamata-kun come.

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:45.260
Saejima and Kamata? I'm not afraid of those guys.

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:47.540
In a fight with the Onibaku, those losers--

00:22:47.640 --> 00:22:49.420
What about those losers?

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:52.580
Mariko-chan sure is a worrywart.

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:57.040
But it is the Kamakura mad
dogs that are coming here.

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:01.080
Makoto!

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:04.990
O-Onizuka-kun... Damna-kun...

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:06.460
Makoto!

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:07.890
What happened?

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:10.330
Who did this to you, Makoto?

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:14.820
You're in danger, Onizuka-kun! Saejima and Kamata...

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:20.300
...are looking for you two.
Their Onibaku hunt has begun!

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:27.110
<i>Just wait, Makoto. I'll avenge you.</i>

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:32.090
Kamakura Station

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:39.000
Dammit... I thought if I came to Kamakura,
someone could tell me something about them.

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:40.360
Where the hell did they go?

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:50.980
Well, well, what have we here?
If it isn't Danma Ryuuji of the Onibaku.

00:23:51.300 --> 00:23:55.640
So, you're Saejima! I've been looking for you!

00:23:55.940 --> 00:23:59.270
Oh! So you came all the way
to Kamakura to find me.

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:01.140
Well, what do you want with me?

00:24:01.490 --> 00:24:04.940
I've come to pay you back
for what you did to Makoto.

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:08.140
Prepare yourself!

00:24:20.010 --> 00:24:23.370
Not bad... I underestimated you.

00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:28.790
You're pretty famous even here in
Kamakura. They call you the Tsujidou Bomb.

00:24:29.380 --> 00:24:31.780
I always thought I'd beat you up someday.

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:36.390
Perfect... I'll show you what
happens when you light my fuse.

00:24:36.800 --> 00:24:38.470
Die!!

00:24:42.630 --> 00:24:46.500
What's wrong? Weren't you gonna kill me?

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:49.600
Are the Kamakura mad dogs all bark and no bite?

00:24:49.600 --> 00:24:51.390
Shut the hell up!

00:24:51.490 --> 00:24:57.090
You're all talk. Without Onizuka,
you're only half a man.

00:24:57.190 --> 00:25:01.240
I'll take care of him with just one
punch. Just watch, Saejima-kun.

00:25:01.640 --> 00:25:04.550
Small fries should step aside.

00:25:04.710 --> 00:25:05.950
I'll shut you up!

00:25:11.220 --> 00:25:14.320
I told you, small fries should stay out of the way!

00:25:16.110 --> 00:25:19.020
Y-You bastard! You're gonna die--

00:25:23.560 --> 00:25:26.330
It's just you, Saejima. Now what?

00:25:26.870 --> 00:25:30.870
I see... not bad for the Onibaku.
It seems the rumors weren't just for show.

00:25:30.970 --> 00:25:34.130
Gonna beg on your hands and knees?
Do it and I'll let you off easy.

00:25:34.230 --> 00:25:37.560
Don't talk shit! You're the one who's gonna
be begging on his hands and knees!

00:25:37.760 --> 00:25:40.320
I'll show you which one of us is talking shit!

00:25:42.120 --> 00:25:45.460
I'll kill you like you wanted, Danma Ryuuji!!

00:25:47.410 --> 00:25:48.120
Kamata-san!

00:25:48.520 --> 00:25:49.980
You're late, Kamata!

00:25:50.250 --> 00:25:53.910
What are you doing, Saejima?
You should've finished him off first thing.

00:25:57.930 --> 00:26:01.360
If you're looking for Kamata and
Saejima, there's no use coming here.

00:26:02.190 --> 00:26:07.130
What are you? A delinquent girl?
this has nothing to do with you. Go home.

00:26:08.180 --> 00:26:11.650
What? Just when I was about
to tell you all about them.

00:26:12.080 --> 00:26:15.240
Since I went to the same
middle school as them and all.

00:26:15.390 --> 00:26:18.600
Really? Then you've gotta tell me all about them!

00:26:19.240 --> 00:26:21.750
And in return...

00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:23.400
treat me to anmitsu!

00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:23.900
Anmitsu - A sweet based on beans, jelly and fruit

00:26:28.850 --> 00:26:31.080
You're a pretty stubborn guy.

00:26:31.180 --> 00:26:34.800
You could've gotten off if you just
bowed your head to Saejima-kun.

00:26:35.080 --> 00:26:37.510
The Onibaku just showed up.

00:26:37.810 --> 00:26:40.690
They're idiots to be taking us on.

00:26:41.150 --> 00:26:44.130
Right now, they're beating up Danma.

00:26:49.640 --> 00:26:50.580
B-Bastard!

00:26:50.680 --> 00:26:51.780
You still wanna go at it?

00:26:53.680 --> 00:26:57.510
You're gonna tell me all about that!

00:27:02.810 --> 00:27:06.190
Hey! All you've done is eat!
Hurry up and tell me about them!

00:27:07.690 --> 00:27:09.840
About Saejima and Kamata!

00:27:10.120 --> 00:27:12.860
Oh, yeah, yeah! I totally forgot...

00:27:14.260 --> 00:27:17.970
I think it was about my second year of
middle school that they became famous.

00:27:18.170 --> 00:27:21.270
But those two were already
well known at our school.

00:27:22.850 --> 00:27:27.390
Anyway, in the third year, they were
surrounded on the street and beat up bad.

00:27:27.490 --> 00:27:29.680
Their revenge was really horrible...

00:27:30.660 --> 00:27:33.970
One by one, they ambushed
the guys that beat them up.

00:27:34.370 --> 00:27:37.520
And beat them with wooden swords and bats, until they were covered in blood.

00:27:38.010 --> 00:27:41.080
After that, no one laid a hand on them.

00:27:42.870 --> 00:27:43.840
I have horrible news, Eikichi-kun!

00:27:44.040 --> 00:27:45.630
What's wrong, Tsukai? Your face--

00:27:46.220 --> 00:27:47.620
I have bad news!

00:27:47.920 --> 00:27:52.140
They said Saejima and Kamata got Ryuuji-kun
and are setting up an ambush in Nishikama!

00:27:52.240 --> 00:27:52.940
What?!

00:27:57.910 --> 00:27:59.990
Turn that off! Who the hell are you?

00:28:08.790 --> 00:28:10.210
Hey, wait!

00:28:11.140 --> 00:28:12.450
Eikichi-kun, look...

00:28:12.770 --> 00:28:14.850
This it's Ryuuji-kun's jacket!

00:28:14.860 --> 00:28:16.090
Caught by the Onibaku hunters.
You're next, Onizuka.

00:28:16.160 --> 00:28:18.000
Caught by the Onibaku hunters.
You're next, Onizuka.

00:28:16.630 --> 00:28:18.240
Could it be Ryuuji-kun's been...

00:28:20.290 --> 00:28:23.070
No problem. I can win this fight!

00:28:28.410 --> 00:28:30.000
The Onibaku ain't nothing.

00:28:30.150 --> 00:28:35.100
I heard they were the strongest in Tsujidou,
so I thought they'd have some backbone.

00:28:35.150 --> 00:28:36.230
But they were nothing.

00:28:36.730 --> 00:28:41.130
At Kamakura these guys
would be nothing but punks.

00:28:41.370 --> 00:28:43.000
Take this!

00:28:44.080 --> 00:28:46.870
Well, don't you have something to say?

00:28:47.380 --> 00:28:49.670
Hey, hey, don't play with him too much.

00:28:49.770 --> 00:28:50.930
Saejima-kun...

00:28:51.370 --> 00:28:57.430
Well, mister celebrity, getting it into your
head who's strongest in Tsujidou, aren't you?

00:28:59.800 --> 00:29:01.470
What's with that look?

00:29:01.870 --> 00:29:03.920
Don't you get it yet?!

00:29:05.520 --> 00:29:06.900
Figured it out yet?

00:29:07.100 --> 00:29:08.410
Fifteen...

00:29:09.810 --> 00:29:13.730
Listen up you bastards...
I'll tell you this, I haven't lost.

00:29:14.230 --> 00:29:17.100
I'm paying close attention to every hit I take.

00:29:17.500 --> 00:29:19.600
So I can pay you back for each and every one later.

00:29:20.100 --> 00:29:25.750
The Onibaku is invincible. We won't lose until the day we die.

00:29:25.850 --> 00:29:28.000
Stop babbling, you punk.

00:29:28.050 --> 00:29:30.840
Are those the words of a man tied
up and with blood on his face?

00:29:31.540 --> 00:29:33.500
You won't lose until you die, huh?

00:29:33.600 --> 00:29:35.740
Then I'll kill you!

00:29:36.960 --> 00:29:39.120
Just like you wanted!!

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:45.830
Strongest in Shonan?!

00:29:46.630 --> 00:29:49.350
There ain't no one stronger than me on this earth!

00:29:50.150 --> 00:29:53.160
Don't get cocky... take this!

00:29:55.950 --> 00:29:58.590
Stop, Kamata! If you go any further he'll really die!

00:29:58.790 --> 00:29:59.390
So what?

00:29:59.490 --> 00:30:01.260
He can't even move.

00:30:02.060 --> 00:30:03.220
I won't forget this...

00:30:08.870 --> 00:30:10.870
T-Twenty-five...

00:30:10.910 --> 00:30:16.630
I'll pay you back for... each and every one.

00:30:21.180 --> 00:30:23.380
Man, this guy has balls!

00:30:23.790 --> 00:30:27.020
Don't let him scare you. All that
loser knows how to do is bluff.

00:30:27.220 --> 00:30:30.870
There ain't nobody who could
fight back after a beating this bad.

00:30:30.970 --> 00:30:33.560
This is where the Onibaku legend ends.

00:30:33.760 --> 00:30:35.100
Just wait, Onizuka!

00:30:35.200 --> 00:30:38.250
Soon, I'll give you the same beating Danma got!

00:30:41.480 --> 00:30:45.120
Wait, Onizuka-kun! You can't go it alone!

00:30:45.220 --> 00:30:46.170
Just shut up...

00:30:46.270 --> 00:30:47.920
Give it up, Tsukai.

00:30:48.120 --> 00:30:48.920
Abe-kun!

00:30:49.120 --> 00:30:51.190
He's not a man you can keep from anything.

00:30:51.290 --> 00:30:54.150
Come on, Abe-kun, you've gotta stop him!

00:30:54.250 --> 00:30:55.090
It's useless...

00:30:55.290 --> 00:30:56.550
Tsukai's right...

00:30:56.650 --> 00:30:59.190
By no means can you go!

00:30:59.290 --> 00:31:01.940
We'll do something about Ryuuji-kun.

00:31:02.340 --> 00:31:04.410
Teachers have nothing to do with this.

00:31:04.510 --> 00:31:08.790
You'll be expelled if you go, understand? Expelled!

00:31:09.690 --> 00:31:11.140
And so what?

00:31:11.500 --> 00:31:12.390
Onizuka-kun...

00:31:12.690 --> 00:31:14.700
Sensei, you can't do that!

00:31:14.900 --> 00:31:16.980
Tsukai-kun, we're teachers...

00:31:17.080 --> 00:31:20.480
We can't let you do this, you
understand, Onizuka-kun?

00:31:20.780 --> 00:31:24.750
Sensei... even if a man knows he's going to lose,

00:31:24.800 --> 00:31:26.600
there are times when he must stand up and fight.

00:31:27.400 --> 00:31:31.450
It doesn't matter that I'll be expelled.
I can't abandon a friend.

00:31:34.730 --> 00:31:35.730
Eikichi-kun!

00:31:36.570 --> 00:31:37.350
Mariko...

00:31:38.450 --> 00:31:39.830
He just has to act cool.

00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:45.360
<i>I'll show you I'm stronger than the Onibaku!</i>

00:31:46.060 --> 00:31:47.560
<i>We'll mess them up!</i>

00:31:49.840 --> 00:31:52.510
Onibaku-kun, please don't get killed.

00:31:52.610 --> 00:31:54.530
If you're killed, I...

00:31:57.270 --> 00:31:59.220
Yo, Makoto, feeling better?

00:31:59.320 --> 00:32:00.660
Sa-Saejima-kun!

00:32:04.220 --> 00:32:06.300
Just wait, Saejima and Kamata...

00:32:06.400 --> 00:32:10.220
I'll show you what happens
when I really get pissed off!

00:32:11.170 --> 00:32:12.460
Wait, Onizuka-kun!

00:32:14.060 --> 00:32:14.700
Makoto...

00:32:14.900 --> 00:32:16.390
What's going on?

00:32:18.470 --> 00:32:22.800
I know where Ryuuji-kun is.
He's not at this apartment.

00:32:24.290 --> 00:32:25.340
Then, where the hell is he?

00:32:25.540 --> 00:32:27.810
In an old warehouse by the beach.

00:32:28.130 --> 00:32:28.710
Show me!

00:32:28.810 --> 00:32:29.510
Y-Yes!

00:32:31.290 --> 00:32:33.690
<i>Sorry, Onizuka-kun, I... I...</i>

00:32:35.480 --> 00:32:36.880
Makoto! Hurry up!

00:32:37.040 --> 00:32:37.660
Y-Yeah!

00:32:40.050 --> 00:32:44.820
Looks like it went well.
Onizuka's a chump too.

00:32:45.920 --> 00:32:48.080
He doesn't even realize he's being tricked.

00:32:48.480 --> 00:32:50.560
Hey... what are you talking about?

00:32:50.760 --> 00:32:53.970
Heh! We told Makoto to lure him into our trap.

00:32:54.150 --> 00:32:56.630
Where Saejima-kun and his
buddies are gonna ambush them.

00:32:57.030 --> 00:32:58.620
That'll be the end of Onizuka...

00:32:58.920 --> 00:33:00.440
and the Onibaku legend!

00:33:00.740 --> 00:33:04.250
What's wrong? Are you that shocked?

00:33:06.550 --> 00:33:09.430
What? Who told you to stand, you little punk?

00:33:09.730 --> 00:33:11.760
You wanna get beaten again, do you?

00:33:12.060 --> 00:33:14.490
You think I'd let myself be beaten by you bastards?

00:33:14.590 --> 00:33:15.430
What are you going t--

00:33:16.430 --> 00:33:17.840
Y-You idiot!!

00:33:19.770 --> 00:33:21.380
<i>I won't be beaten by you!</i>

00:33:21.880 --> 00:33:23.700
T-That idiot!

00:33:23.750 --> 00:33:26.170
There's gonna be serious
problems if you die, you bastard!

00:33:26.270 --> 00:33:27.340
Quick! Call an ambulance!

00:33:30.740 --> 00:33:31.950
W-What?!

00:33:32.050 --> 00:33:33.810
Where'd you go, you bastard?

00:33:36.470 --> 00:33:38.540
Yo! Thanks for coming out to meet me.

00:33:38.940 --> 00:33:40.800
You bastard! That was an act?!

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:45.620
Yeah! I couldn't think of anything other
than using broken glass to cut the ropes.

00:33:46.020 --> 00:33:48.140
I did almost cut an artery, though.

00:33:48.540 --> 00:33:51.920
Are you freaking crazy? You could've
died from slitting your wrists!

00:33:52.020 --> 00:33:55.800
Nothing's wrong with being
crazy in a fight, you dumbshit!

00:34:00.230 --> 00:34:01.520
Makoto, wait here.

00:34:01.720 --> 00:34:02.520
O-Okay.

00:34:10.540 --> 00:34:13.660
Onizuka-kun, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:34:18.560 --> 00:34:21.050
Saejima! Show yourself!

00:34:24.740 --> 00:34:27.870
Welcome to the place where the Onibaku will end.

00:34:29.450 --> 00:34:32.320
This is the last stop for the Onibaku legend.

00:34:33.120 --> 00:34:35.020
What's that supposed to mean?

00:34:36.430 --> 00:34:38.510
Makoto... I told you to wait.

00:34:39.110 --> 00:34:42.010
Makoto, sorry for asking you
to do something like this.

00:34:42.610 --> 00:34:45.380
Well, seems like you're gonna
make a great errand boy.

00:34:45.720 --> 00:34:47.700
Makoto, don't tell me you...

00:34:49.500 --> 00:34:54.730
I asked Makoto to bring you here
if he didn't want me to kill him.

00:34:55.030 --> 00:34:56.350
P-Please, forgive me!

00:34:57.050 --> 00:34:58.150
Makoto...

00:34:58.350 --> 00:34:59.530
Makoto!!

00:34:59.900 --> 00:35:01.390
Let me go!

00:35:03.380 --> 00:35:05.980
What the hell are you thinking?
I'm gonna kill you!

00:35:06.080 --> 00:35:10.770
Y-You bastards! I'm not going
to let you off easy for this!

00:35:10.970 --> 00:35:13.670
What? I can't hear you!

00:35:16.460 --> 00:35:18.430
Where's the Onibaku's invincibility now?

00:35:18.630 --> 00:35:21.260
Just try and takes us!

00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:23.260
Take this!

00:35:24.030 --> 00:35:26.860
<i>Sorry... I'm so sorry, Onizuka-kun!</i>

00:35:27.360 --> 00:35:30.230
<i>I'm worthless. I'm afraid of being hit.</i>

00:35:33.680 --> 00:35:34.880
Stupid Makoto-kun!

00:35:35.700 --> 00:35:40.530
<i>Always picked on, I had to do exactly
what I was told so I could protect myself.</i>

00:35:40.630 --> 00:35:44.540
<i>I'm the kind of loser who
can't live any other way.</i>

00:35:48.660 --> 00:35:53.160
Ma-Makoto... they're lying, right?
You'd never betray me, would you?

00:35:54.360 --> 00:35:56.720
You think it's time to take your eyes of the target?

00:36:05.360 --> 00:36:06.520
Makoto...!

00:36:06.920 --> 00:36:10.170
<i>It's useless, Eikichi-kun! I... I...</i>

00:36:10.830 --> 00:36:13.660
Well now, play time is over, Onizuka.

00:36:14.060 --> 00:36:16.140
Allow me to finish this once and for all!!

00:36:30.430 --> 00:36:34.270
Makoto... y-you little piece of shit!

00:36:34.670 --> 00:36:36.110
Makoto, you...

00:36:36.310 --> 00:36:40.790
I-I could never betray you!
I like you you much, Eikichi-kun!

00:36:41.590 --> 00:36:42.780
Don't mess with us!

00:36:43.010 --> 00:36:45.200
Have it your way! We'll kill you too!

00:36:45.300 --> 00:36:46.720
Right along with Onizuka!

00:36:49.470 --> 00:36:51.350
Along with who?

00:36:56.850 --> 00:36:57.850
You son of a bitch...!

00:36:59.420 --> 00:37:02.410
Well, how about I show you
what you've been waiting for?

00:37:02.590 --> 00:37:05.340
The legendary Onibaku!

00:37:07.380 --> 00:37:08.320
Eikichi-kun...

00:37:11.930 --> 00:37:14.090
What? You beat Danma of the Onibaku?!

00:37:14.190 --> 00:37:16.290
Yeah... it was child's play.

00:37:16.750 --> 00:37:21.200
Right now he looks like a frozen tuna,
rolling around in Saejima's apartment...

00:37:21.300 --> 00:37:22.980
with blood all over his face.

00:37:23.680 --> 00:37:25.220
That's awesome!

00:37:38.710 --> 00:37:40.870
Let's have some fun, Kamata.

00:37:41.470 --> 00:37:43.460
How about we continue the Onibaku hunt?

00:37:43.760 --> 00:37:44.970
Da-Danma...!

00:37:45.070 --> 00:37:48.820
I'll show you our real strength.

00:37:49.190 --> 00:37:51.460
Y-You bastard!

00:37:56.120 --> 00:37:59.230
<i>A-Awesome! Eikichi-kun is really awesome!</i>

00:38:00.030 --> 00:38:04.060
It's about time for our one-on-one.
What're you gonna do, Saejima?

00:38:04.290 --> 00:38:07.120
Wouldn't you be better off running
and leaving your buddies behind?

00:38:07.600 --> 00:38:12.140
Don't talk shit. You really think
you can beat me one-on-one?

00:38:13.610 --> 00:38:17.700
Oh, yeah... there was a dumbshit like you
who tried to stand up to me in middle school.

00:38:18.170 --> 00:38:22.640
The loser was the boss of Hamaji Middle
School. Do you know what happened to him?

00:38:23.440 --> 00:38:28.070
His jaw was so much fractured that
doctors had to insert a metal plate.

00:38:28.370 --> 00:38:31.550
After that, no one dared say they could beat me.

00:38:33.150 --> 00:38:36.610
I'm a scary guy. Do you get it? Do you, Onizuka?

00:38:37.460 --> 00:38:40.400
Feel like getting down on your hands and knees and begging for your life yet?

00:38:40.800 --> 00:38:44.010
You fool... you're gonna be the one begging.

00:39:07.530 --> 00:39:09.590
He took out Saejima-kun in one punch!

00:39:09.790 --> 00:39:12.220
He's strong... way too strong!

00:39:13.900 --> 00:39:17.400
It's ten years too early for you to be talking like that to me.

00:39:22.930 --> 00:39:27.450
You're really strong, Eikichi-kun, but I...

00:39:34.040 --> 00:39:39.450
What's wrong, Kamata?
You think you can beat me like that?

00:39:40.260 --> 00:39:44.630
Don't shoot your mouth off! You're
not the only one who's undefeated!

00:39:44.730 --> 00:39:47.700
Who the hell would lose to
someone like you anyway?!

00:39:54.830 --> 00:39:57.760
This is the beginning of the end for you.

00:39:58.740 --> 00:40:00.190
You bastard...!

00:40:00.590 --> 00:40:04.700
I don't care if you are the Onibaku, don't
think you're the toughest guy around!

00:40:05.100 --> 00:40:07.850
I'll tear you apart right along with your pride!

00:40:08.350 --> 00:40:12.760
Twelve! Thirteen! Fourteen! Fifteen!

00:40:14.460 --> 00:40:17.350
Amazing! Kamata can't even get in one hit!

00:40:17.650 --> 00:40:20.900
The difference in strength is too
much. So this is the Onibaku!

00:40:22.070 --> 00:40:25.840
What's wrong? We're only up to twenty-one!

00:40:27.410 --> 00:40:28.330
Kamata-kun!

00:40:28.760 --> 00:40:32.700
What's wrong, Kamata? I haven't told you that you could lose yet, have I?

00:40:33.310 --> 00:40:35.420
Who says I've lost?

00:40:36.180 --> 00:40:38.930
You think I'd lose to you?!

00:40:40.740 --> 00:40:42.970
I won't lose to anyone!

00:40:45.260 --> 00:40:45.830
Kamata-kun!

00:40:45.930 --> 00:40:47.390
Kamata-kun, stop!

00:40:47.530 --> 00:40:48.500
Shut up!!

00:40:48.900 --> 00:40:51.400
Die, Onibaku!!

00:40:57.050 --> 00:41:00.000
Did you think you could beat
me by showing off your cutlery?

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:03.620
<i>What the hell is this guy?</i>

00:41:06.770 --> 00:41:09.590
<i>I can't go head to head with him!
There's no contest...</i>

00:41:10.310 --> 00:41:15.500
<i>This guy's too strong!
There's no way I can beat this guy...</i>

00:41:25.830 --> 00:41:28.050
I got my payback in full, Kamata.

00:41:28.560 --> 00:41:32.020
Ryuuji... not bad!

00:41:32.120 --> 00:41:35.920
Not bad yourself! By the way, is it
true that Makoto betrayed you?

00:41:41.890 --> 00:41:45.170
No way! We both went in fighting.

00:41:45.730 --> 00:41:47.780
He even saved me when I was in trouble.

00:41:48.460 --> 00:41:50.410
<i>Onizuka-kun... thank you!</i>

00:41:52.300 --> 00:41:54.240
I'll be counting on you in the future, Makoto!

00:41:54.440 --> 00:41:55.200
Onizuka-kun...

00:41:55.640 --> 00:41:57.410
With girls too, of course!

00:42:01.150 --> 00:42:02.820
That Makoto really went all out.

00:42:03.660 --> 00:42:08.070
Yeah, it looks like he'll be a
lot more manly from now on.

00:42:08.260 --> 00:42:09.290
Oh, yeah...

00:42:09.560 --> 00:42:12.810
Hey, looking good! Let's go out somewhere.

00:42:13.350 --> 00:42:14.120
I don't know...

00:42:14.220 --> 00:42:15.650
Come on, come on!

00:42:17.910 --> 00:42:19.170
Makoto!

00:42:21.630 --> 00:42:24.070
And I was feeling sorry for you, you bastard!

00:42:24.170 --> 00:42:25.980
Don't hold out on us!

00:42:26.080 --> 00:42:27.930
I'm sorry!

00:42:28.030 --> 00:42:29.700
You trying to make fun of us?!

00:42:29.800 --> 00:42:30.800
No!

00:42:30.900 --> 00:42:32.230
At least introduce me to one girl!

00:42:32.330 --> 00:42:33.220
C'mon!

00:42:33.420 --> 00:42:35.610
You never treat us to any girls!

00:42:36.210 --> 00:42:37.650
I'll kill you!

00:42:41.390 --> 00:42:44.690
(There's more after the credits!)

00:44:12.330 --> 00:44:14.620
Damn! That stings!

00:44:15.140 --> 00:44:19.270
That rotten Onizuka, adding insult to injury.

00:44:19.370 --> 00:44:24.120
"Let's go drinking", he says.
That crosses the line!

00:44:24.400 --> 00:44:26.040
Well, what's it matter?

00:44:26.540 --> 00:44:28.080
In the end we were the losers.

00:44:28.180 --> 00:44:31.360
Since when are you do damn humble?

00:44:31.460 --> 00:44:32.660
Doesn't it bother you?

00:44:32.760 --> 00:44:35.140
It does. It does bother me.

00:44:35.640 --> 00:44:38.050
But it feels refreshing in some way.

00:44:39.740 --> 00:44:40.670
I guess...

00:44:40.770 --> 00:44:43.170
Been a long time since I've been to a bath house!

00:44:43.270 --> 00:44:45.740
Now this is a bath! Lots of room to stretch out in.

00:44:45.840 --> 00:44:47.180
O-Onibaku!

00:44:47.280 --> 00:44:51.060
Ah? If it isn't the Kamakura losers!

00:44:51.160 --> 00:44:51.980
Hey, you...!

00:44:52.060 --> 00:44:56.390
You're making a big mistake, Onizuka...
if you think you can beat me again!

00:44:56.730 --> 00:45:00.970
Oh! You aren't still saying
you can beat me, are you?

00:45:01.200 --> 00:45:05.940
Good! Let me teach you how
strong I am one more time!

00:45:06.250 --> 00:45:08.210
Sure! You wanna go at it right here?

00:45:10.540 --> 00:45:13.740
What the hell are you staring and
laughing about, you bastard?!

00:45:13.840 --> 00:45:17.640
For such a strong fighter, you're packing
a really innocent little thing, aren't you?

00:45:17.740 --> 00:45:20.860
Don't change the subject, you moron!

00:45:22.660 --> 00:45:24.510
It's like it's in hiding...!

00:45:25.830 --> 00:45:28.250
Saejima! You bastard!

00:45:28.660 --> 00:45:30.080
Really...

00:45:30.230 --> 00:45:33.190
Eikichi, I didn't know you were that small!

00:45:34.050 --> 00:45:36.690
Well, how about you then, Ryuuji, huh?

00:45:37.750 --> 00:45:39.710
Well, what do you think?

00:45:42.240 --> 00:45:44.410
Oh...! Not bad Danma!

00:45:44.510 --> 00:45:47.230
Not bad yourself, Saejima.
You must really get around.

00:45:47.330 --> 00:45:50.210
C'mon, what's the big deal about size?

00:45:50.680 --> 00:45:51.980
Ka-Kamata!

00:45:52.080 --> 00:45:56.340
You're all like kids, aren't you? Act your age.

00:45:56.440 --> 00:46:00.040
Yeah... you've got quite a big
towel wrapped around you!

00:46:00.140 --> 00:46:02.640
A guy can't help but think you're hiding something.

00:46:03.770 --> 00:46:05.780
You have a problem with that?

00:46:06.390 --> 00:46:08.310
He's hiding something!

00:46:08.410 --> 00:46:09.650
Leave me alone!

00:46:13.700 --> 00:46:15.630
He's going around bald!

00:46:16.030 --> 00:46:17.770
S-Shut up! Little man!

00:46:17.870 --> 00:46:20.700
What? You wanna fight, you little eel man?

00:46:20.890 --> 00:46:23.680
Shut up! You little green turtle in hiding!

00:46:34.610 --> 00:46:38.040
Yo, what are you guys doing together?

00:46:38.240 --> 00:46:42.400
What's with that crazy thing?!

00:46:42.450 --> 00:46:45.090
Huh, oh, that?

00:46:45.590 --> 00:46:49.560
I've forged it in battle.

00:46:50.360 --> 00:46:53.310
And what's with that bulge?

00:46:53.410 --> 00:46:54.850
Oh, this?

00:46:55.050 --> 00:46:55.850
It's a pearl.

00:46:55.950 --> 00:46:57.530
P-Pearl?

00:46:57.630 --> 00:46:59.010
I had it put in two years ago.

00:46:59.140 --> 00:47:01.340
T-Two years ago?! You were...

00:47:01.540 --> 00:47:03.290
I-In middle school?!

00:47:16.480 --> 00:47:20.080
Oh! What's going on? Everyone's here!

00:47:20.320 --> 00:47:21.930
What are you so excited about?

00:47:22.030 --> 00:47:25.210
Don't tell me you're been comparing your things?

00:47:25.310 --> 00:47:27.820
So, who was biggest?

00:47:29.420 --> 00:47:31.500
Don't make fun of us, you little bastard!

00:47:31.600 --> 00:47:33.880
What's size matter anyway?

00:47:33.990 --> 00:47:35.750
What're you so mad about all of a sudden?

00:47:35.850 --> 00:47:38.720
Don't get a big head just because your thing is big!

00:47:38.820 --> 00:47:40.920
What did I do to deserve this?

00:47:41.840 --> 00:47:44.590
A man's life is made up of more than just his thing!
